## 1.

The Smart Attendance Analyzer is a project that helps students keep track of their attendance. Attendance is a part of academic life. Many schools require students to attend least 75% of their classes. Some students have a time keeping track of their attendance and end up getting in trouble for not attending enough classes.

The Smart Attendance Analyzer is designed to help students monitor their attendance and make decisions about which classes to attend. The Smart Attendance Analyzer is a tool that students can use to stay on top of their attendance.

---

## 2. Problem Statement

Students often have a lot of trouble with attendance. Here are some of the issues that students face:

* It is hard to calculate attendance percentage by hand

* Students do not know how classes they need to attend

* Students do not know how classes they can miss without getting in trouble

* Students risk falling below the required attendance threshold

The Smart Attendance Analyzer is a project that aims to solve these problems. The Smart Attendance Analyzer provides a simple and easy to use tool that helps students stay on top of their attendance.

