## 3. Objective

The main goals of the Smart Attendance Analyzer project are:

* To calculate attendance percentage accurately

* To determine how classes students need to attend to reach 75% attendance

* To figure out how classes students can miss without getting in trouble

* To provide a user- interface that is easy to use

The Smart Attendance Analyzer is designed to be a helpful tool for students. The Smart Attendance Analyzer project has main objectives that it aims to achieve.

